{
  "bookId": "hero-214005",
  "id": "bond-27527",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27527001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "主公大人，这里有一封属于你的信。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "光秀啊，这是什么信？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "在下写给主公的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咦，有什么事情不能当面说吗，里面写了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "不是情书。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……我当然知道这不是情书！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "算了，我自己看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "还请主公于三日后拆开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "既然是三日后才能让我拆开的东西，为什么现在要给我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "三日后，主公便会知晓。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……这家伙就这么走掉了？这么放心我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "果然还是很好奇啊。三天，谁能等那么长的时间。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "稍微看一点点，应该也不会有什么问题吧，反正他不可能发现。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "装满钱的信封",
          "text": "主公你太心急了，请三日后再拆开。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27527015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
